{"id":"e579638af7cadfbf8e334fb67b4c64523a16ce85","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/030/931.htm","title":"3399 元起荣耀 700 / 700S / Pro 系列手机发布：AI 灵动背屏、支持长焦增距镜","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：漾仔","excerpt":"荣耀 700 系列全系配备 1.59 英寸 AI 灵动背屏与 6.57 英寸绿洲护眼屏，支持 2 亿柔光背屏自拍。Pro 版搭载骁龙 8 Gen5 与 9000mAh 青海湖电池，搭配 G200 增距镜可实现 15 倍舞台 Live 拍摄。##荣耀700系列发布会##","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"ithome://contentlist?api=https%3A%2F%2Fnapi.ithome.com%2Fapi%2Ftopmenu%2Fgetfeeds%3Ftopmenuid%3D230&title=%E7%8E%B0%E5%9C%BA&mode=1\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/app-images/on-the-sence.png?v=20260929\" w=\"1200\" h=\"200\"></a></p>\r\n            <p data-vmark=\"e660\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 11 月 23 日现场消息，在目前正在进行的<span data-topic-logo=\"//pimg.ithome.com/products/2026/11/09/e8a225a2-24ef-4dda-bddf-b0808a472420.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" data-topic-id=\"70250\">荣耀 700</span> 系列暨全场景新品发布会中，荣耀 700 / 700S / Pro 系列手机正式发布。</p><dir><a contenteditable=\"false\" href=\"https://u.jd.com/oGxsJxp\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oOxK5qS\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oGxsHYK\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/orx8OH3\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/oDxQAwR\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oDxGwpG\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oDxwgJr\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252foaxCyhK%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\" data-itwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/orxCmCv\" data-lpwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oGkofmE\" data-ncid=\"277930\"><span><span><img src=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/552947/23/10713/22980/6aebf79fFe661d554/008332032061903b.png\" w=\"800\" h=\"800\" title=\"3399 元起荣耀 700 / 700S / Pro 系列手机发布：AI 灵动背屏、支持长焦增距镜\" data-original=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/552947/23/10713/22980/6aebf79fFe661d